(7649540, 1244348, 99263, '<td valign="top">Dramatic! Nice processing with lovely details and contrasts. Is it just my imagination or is the scene perhaps tilted a little to much to the right? The centre mountain structure looks perfectly straight but the mountain on the left and on the right look like they are slanting a bit to the right.</td>', 'Dramatic! Nice processing with lovely details and contrasts. Is it just my imagination or is the scene perhaps tilted a little to much to the right? The centre mountain structure looks perfectly straight but the mountain on the left and on the right look like they are slanting a bit to the right.', '2020-01-04 03:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
