(7649984, 1244142, 15002, '<td valign="top">My old stomping grounds. I think the composition would benefit from more pier... leading line more into the frame... less of the clumpy sand in the lower left</td>', 'My old stomping grounds. I think the composition would benefit from more pier... leading line more into the frame... less of the clumpy sand in the lower left', '2020-01-08 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649985, 1244167, 15002, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2020-01-08 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649986, 1244349, 15002, '<td valign="top">Bravo. Sharp throughout.</td>', 'Bravo. Sharp throughout.', '2020-01-08 17:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649987, 1244073, 15002, '<td valign="top">Excellent texture and detail in the dock and cabin. Blownout sky behind/above takes way from the excellent composition</td>', 'Excellent texture and detail in the dock and cabin. Blownout sky behind/above takes way from the excellent composition', '2020-01-08 17:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649988, 1244148, 15002, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Crop the top off and it would be even better in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice.  Crop the top off and it would be even better in my opinion.', '2020-01-08 17:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649989, 1244339, 15002, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Sharp detail, smooth sky.  Perhaps a bit lighter on the mid point to lighten the overall image?</td>', 'Beautiful.  Sharp detail, smooth sky.  Perhaps a bit lighter on the mid point to lighten the overall image?', '2020-01-08 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649993, 1244363, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. The clouds look like a dust storm.</td>', 'Cool picture. The clouds look like a dust storm.', '2020-01-08 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649994, 1244142, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines. The pier and the clouds take my eye right to that black projection. I wonder what that is?</td>', 'I like the leading lines. The pier and the clouds take my eye right to that black projection. I wonder what that is?', '2020-01-08 21:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649995, 1244348, 3306, '<td valign="top">The contrast is amazing. Very cool picture.</td>', 'The contrast is amazing. Very cool picture.', '2020-01-08 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649996, 1244351, 3306, '<td valign="top">I used to have dreams of flying when I was a child. This reminds me of that.</td>', 'I used to have dreams of flying when I was a child. This reminds me of that.', '2020-01-08 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649998, 1244360, 3306, '<td valign="top">An interesting tree. As I travel through your picture I wonder what is up the road a piece.</td>', 'An interesting tree. As I travel through your picture I wonder what is up the road a piece.', '2020-01-08 21:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649999, 1244321, 3306, '<td valign="top">A picture full of visual interest. Is that a war memorial?</td>', 'A picture full of visual interest. Is that a war memorial?', '2020-01-08 21:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650001, 1244167, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the tree in the mist and the negative space around it. I cant quite decide if I would prefer the crop just below the upper dark area and make this a panoramic. Its good either way.</td>', 'Love the tree in the mist and the negative space around it. I cant quite decide if I would prefer the crop just below the upper dark area and make this a panoramic. Its good either way.', '2020-01-08 21:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650002, 1244237, 3306, '<td valign="top">Doesnt look like anybody is going to be fighting for a parking space on this street!</td>', 'Doesnt look like anybody is going to be fighting for a parking space on this street!', '2020-01-08 21:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650003, 1244215, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice serene picture. Looks like not too many neighbors around.</td>', 'Nice serene picture. Looks like not too many neighbors around.', '2020-01-08 21:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650004, 1244334, 3306, '<td valign="top">Ostriches always make me smile. They are so goofy looking. I like your perspective of them.</td>', 'Ostriches always make me smile. They are so goofy looking. I like your perspective of them.', '2020-01-08 21:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650005, 1243976, 3306, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice place to take a peaceful walk. I like the sun rays peaking through.</td>', 'Looks like a nice place to take a peaceful walk. I like the sun rays peaking through.', '2020-01-08 21:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650006, 1244344, 3306, '<td valign="top">Looks like Cape Cod! If it is I think i know who you are:) or is it?</td>', 'Looks like Cape Cod! If it is I think i know who you are:) or is it?', '2020-01-08 21:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650007, 1244311, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines. I like the geometry of this. Very sleek.</td>', 'Interesting lines. I like the geometry of this. Very sleek.', '2020-01-08 21:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650008, 1244095, 3306, '<td valign="top">Lights and shadows. Interesting contrasts.</td>', 'Lights and shadows. Interesting contrasts.', '2020-01-08 21:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650010, 1244347, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and shadows. I like that you didnt overdo the contrast.</td>', 'Interesting lines and shadows. I like that you didnt overdo the contrast.', '2020-01-08 22:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650012, 1244338, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. It looks peaceful. I think I would like it even better if it was cropped just below the kayaks above. Just my opinion:)</td>', 'I really like this picture. It looks peaceful. I think I would like it even better if it was cropped just below the kayaks above. Just my opinion:)', '2020-01-08 22:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650013, 1244339, 3306, '<td valign="top">Really sharp DOF. Looks good in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Really sharp DOF. Looks good in B&W.', '2020-01-08 22:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650042, 1243976, 114285, '<td valign="top">Stunning beam!</td>', 'Stunning beam!', '2020-01-09 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650053, 1244349, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp. Great DOF and picturesque sky. The perfect formula for an excellent picture.</td>', 'Beautifully sharp. Great DOF and picturesque sky. The perfect formula for an excellent picture.', '2020-01-09 06:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650054, 1244027, 3306, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks like a lot of peaceful sharing of the road going on here! Dont see any bikes though! I always enjoy going to these kind of street fairs. Good capture of an everyday scene.</td>', 'Definitely looks like a lot of peaceful sharing of the road going on here! Dont see any bikes though! I always enjoy going to these kind of street fairs. Good capture of an everyday scene.', '2020-01-09 07:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650056, 1244129, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like your use of the vignette to highlight the mountain. It gives it a bold and ominous appearance.</td>', 'I like your use of the vignette to highlight the mountain. It gives it a bold and ominous appearance.', '2020-01-09 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650057, 1244299, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern of the fences. You have a good angle to capture as much as you can within the frame. In my mind I imagine that it would be cool if there was a big dog jumping on the door in the foreground!</td>', 'I like the pattern of the fences. You have a good angle to capture as much as you can within the frame. In my mind I imagine that it would be cool if there was a big dog jumping on the door in the foreground!', '2020-01-09 07:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650058, 1244364, 3306, '<td valign="top">I know this is your style. Im still trying to figure it out!</td>', 'I know this is your style. Im still trying to figure it out!', '2020-01-09 07:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650059, 1244357, 3306, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a time when I was out shooting pictures of geese. From a distance I saw a farm field full of geese. I wanted to sneak up on them and see if I could get some pictures of the flock taking off into the sky. I parked the car a distance away so as not to scare them. Slowly I snuck up on them. Luckily they did not seem to be startled as I approached. Then I noticed they werent moving at all. It was a field of decoys! I looked around to make sure no one was looking. Boy did I feel stupid!</td>', 'This reminds me of a time when I was out shooting pictures of geese. From a distance I saw a farm field full of geese. I wanted to sneak up on them and see if I could get some pictures of the flock taking off into the sky. I parked the car a distance away so as not to scare them. Slowly I snuck up on them. Luckily they did not seem to be startled as I approached. Then I noticed they werent moving at all. It was a field of decoys! I looked around to make sure no one was looking. Boy did I feel stupid!', '2020-01-09 07:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650060, 1244346, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the sparkling water with the silhouette of the family on the pier. A typical family shot with the dad playing with the kids and the mom looking over to make sure they dont kill themselves! Nice capture.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the sparkling water with the silhouette of the family on the pier. A typical family shot with the dad playing with the kids and the mom looking over to make sure they dont kill themselves! Nice capture.', '2020-01-09 07:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650061, 1244148, 3306, '<td valign="top">Awesome scene. I love the contrast of the straight lines of the clouds against the rolling hills. The mist gives it an ephemeral feel.</td>', 'Awesome scene. I love the contrast of the straight lines of the clouds against the rolling hills. The mist gives it an ephemeral feel.', '2020-01-09 07:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650062, 1244135, 3306, '<td valign="top">A nice country scene.</td>', 'A nice country scene.', '2020-01-09 07:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650063, 1244303, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very cool viewpoint. I like the texture of the water. I kind of like it when I scroll up to crop out the horizon. It makes it more like a panorama and accentuates the negative space, the ripples in the water and draws my eye more to the lighthouse. Still a very good picture.</td>', 'Very cool viewpoint. I like the texture of the water. I kind of like it when I scroll up to crop out the horizon. It makes it more like a panorama and accentuates the negative space, the ripples in the water and draws my eye more to the lighthouse. Still a very good picture.', '2020-01-09 07:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650064, 1244289, 3306, '<td valign="top">I always like reflections in water. This has a very dark feeling to it. I would like to see how it looks in B&amp;W and bringing up the brightness a little to define the buildings and clouds.</td>', 'I always like reflections in water. This has a very dark feeling to it. I would like to see how it looks in B&W and bringing up the brightness a little to define the buildings and clouds.', '2020-01-09 07:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650065, 1244350, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have made a good attempt at showing the details of a somewhat gloomy day. Its very hard to expose the snow adequately without making the rest of the scene too dark and visa versa.</td>', 'You have made a good attempt at showing the details of a somewhat gloomy day. Its very hard to expose the snow adequately without making the rest of the scene too dark and visa versa.', '2020-01-09 07:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650066, 1244361, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like your title in that it makes sense of what you were thinking about when you took this picture. Of course its not a glamorous mind blowing landscape, but it shows an average day in the city as people are walking home from work. Everyone can relate.</td>', 'I like your title in that it makes sense of what you were thinking about when you took this picture. Of course its not a glamorous mind blowing landscape, but it shows an average day in the city as people are walking home from work. Everyone can relate.', '2020-01-09 07:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650067, 1244168, 3306, '<td valign="top">I always try to understand what the photographer was thinking when they compose and take a picture. At first I see a scene of dirt and brush, interesting clouds and your title which suggests a beach scene. Then I see the smokestack in the background and I wonder what its relevance is in your composition. Maybe Im reading too much into it but Im imagining that you are making a statement about the environment, possibly the effects of global warming and mans role in it all. Am I right? If that is the case I give you high marks for a very introspective and controversial creative composition.</td>', 'I always try to understand what the photographer was thinking when they compose and take a picture. At first I see a scene of dirt and brush, interesting clouds and your title which suggests a beach scene. Then I see the smokestack in the background and I wonder what its relevance is in your composition. Maybe Im reading too much into it but Im imagining that you are making a statement about the environment, possibly the effects of global warming and mans role in it all. Am I right? If that is the case I give you high marks for a very introspective and controversial creative composition.', '2020-01-09 08:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650068, 1244342, 3306, '<td valign="top">I wonder how old that tree is? Wouldnt you like to know what it has seen in its lifetime?</td>', 'I wonder how old that tree is? Wouldnt you like to know what it has seen in its lifetime?', '2020-01-09 08:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650069, 1244073, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the way the tree branches frame the building. It also helps to block out the upper part of the sky where it isnt as interesting as the bottom 2/3rds of the picture. I think you have done a good job with what you have here.</td>', 'I like the way the tree branches frame the building. It also helps to block out the upper part of the sky where it isnt as interesting as the bottom 2/3rds of the picture. I think you have done a good job with what you have here.', '2020-01-09 08:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650070, 1244327, 3306, '<td valign="top">Sometimes nature does not cooperate with the image we have in our eyes. I think your intent and subject matter is interesting. I wish Mother Nature had given you a more interesting sky. Just my opinion but I wonder how it would look if you came back on another day when the water is more calm in front And there is a sharper reflection in the water. The break in the water around the island and the ripples in front breaks up the continuity for me. On the other hand you may like the texture and the grain created by the ripples. Its just a matter of taste. Isnt that what art is all about?</td>', 'Sometimes nature does not cooperate with the image we have in our eyes. I think your intent and subject matter is interesting. I wish Mother Nature had given you a more interesting sky. Just my opinion but I wonder how it would look if you came back on another day when the water is more calm in front And there is a sharper reflection in the water. The break in the water around the island and the ripples in front breaks up the continuity for me. On the other hand you may like the texture and the grain created by the ripples. Its just a matter of taste. Isnt that what art is all about?', '2020-01-09 08:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650071, 1244332, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like your artistic presentation of the trees seemingly reaching for the sky. It has almost a Van Gogh swirling surreal feeling to it.</td>', 'I like your artistic presentation of the trees seemingly reaching for the sky. It has almost a Van Gogh swirling surreal feeling to it.', '2020-01-09 08:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650072, 1244291, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting minimalistic approach. There is a lot to be seen in this scene. A large field with grazing sheep (?). People  walking in the field makes me wonder their intent. The interesting pattern of trees and fence. Was this taken with a drone?</td>', 'Very interesting minimalistic approach. There is a lot to be seen in this scene. A large field with grazing sheep (?). People  walking in the field makes me wonder their intent. The interesting pattern of trees and fence. Was this taken with a drone?', '2020-01-09 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
