(7650209, 1244142, 29486, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ThingFish:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely scene with nice lines but horizon is very slightly down tilted to the right and the pylons of the pier seem to be slightly slanted tothe right also. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s an ultra wide angle lens so it has a bit of bend. I did use line straightening on it to try and ensure the most level horizon.</td>', 'Originally posted by ThingFish: Lovely scene with nice lines but horizon is very slightly down tilted to the right and the pylons of the pier seem to be slightly slanted tothe right also.   It''s an ultra wide angle lens so it has a bit of bend. I did use line straightening on it to try and ensure the most level horizon.', '2020-01-10 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650210, 1244142, 29486, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by spydr:</b></div><hr/><i> My old stomping grounds. I think the composition would benefit from more pier... leading line more into the frame... less of the clumpy sand in the lower left </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That would be my outtake. :)  My originals started with more pier but I liked the wave action on this one best. I totally missed the clump on the left though. The beach was very busy so it was hard to shoot without people.</td>', 'Originally posted by spydr: My old stomping grounds. I think the composition would benefit from more pier... leading line more into the frame... less of the clumpy sand in the lower left   That would be my outtake. :)  My originals started with more pier but I liked the wave action on this one best. I totally missed the clump on the left though. The beach was very busy so it was hard to shoot without people.', '2020-01-10 18:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650211, 1244142, 29486, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the leading lines. The pier and the clouds take my eye right to that black projection. I wonder what that is? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s a Christmas Tree! I didn''t expect that out there when I got there.</td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: I like the leading lines. The pier and the clouds take my eye right to that black projection. I wonder what that is?   It''s a Christmas Tree! I didn''t expect that out there when I got there.', '2020-01-10 18:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650252, 1244361, 173844, '<td valign="top">The feeling of this moment is deeply resonant.  Forgive me if I feel you''re speaking directly to me.  Overtones of Stieglitz.</td>', 'The feeling of this moment is deeply resonant.  Forgive me if I feel you''re speaking directly to me.  Overtones of Stieglitz.', '2020-01-11 08:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650297, 1244143, 67145, '<td valign="top">stunning capture Jo .. loving the black and white edit . :)</td>', 'stunning capture Jo .. loving the black and white edit . :)', '2020-01-11 18:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650299, 1244303, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is this the lighthouse near downtown Chicago? Too bad you got chased off, but I guess that''s going to be common for some of the best areas to use it in. I''d love to get some pics of this lighthouse frozen over sometime. <br/> <br/>Hoping to give you some competition with the drone shots soon. Thanks all for the advice.</td>', 'Is this the lighthouse near downtown Chicago? Too bad you got chased off, but I guess that''s going to be common for some of the best areas to use it in. I''d love to get some pics of this lighthouse frozen over sometime.  Hoping to give you some competition with the drone shots soon. Thanks all for the advice.', '2020-01-11 19:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650332, 1244344, 83313, '<td valign="top">Afraid I was one of the lowball votes on this one. Main reason was all the choppy artifacts in the sky.</td>', 'Afraid I was one of the lowball votes on this one. Main reason was all the choppy artifacts in the sky.', '2020-01-12 02:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650335, 1244148, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.  This seems a sort of musical staff, the notes and undulating harmonies comprised of trees, clouds and mountains.  The ever-present singing of the world.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.  This seems a sort of musical staff, the notes and undulating harmonies comprised of trees, clouds and mountains.  The ever-present singing of the world.', '2020-01-12 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650336, 1244258, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such a telling, affecting image.  He or she is looking behind, as if at what was.  But dogs don''t dwell in the past.  They''re all about the present.  The perspective is brilliant.  Best fortune to you both.</td>', 'Such a telling, affecting image.  He or she is looking behind, as if at what was.  But dogs don''t dwell in the past.  They''re all about the present.  The perspective is brilliant.  Best fortune to you both.', '2020-01-12 09:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650337, 1244339, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such an evocative image.  It plunges me back into my western sojourn.  Every pebble and sprig is accounted for, every articulation of the landscape.  Is that a contrail in the sky?  I thought it was, and gave this an eight rather than a nine.</td>', 'Such an evocative image.  It plunges me back into my western sojourn.  Every pebble and sprig is accounted for, every articulation of the landscape.  Is that a contrail in the sky?  I thought it was, and gave this an eight rather than a nine.', '2020-01-12 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650338, 1244129, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of this mountain complex in this weather.  I love the moody darkness surmounted by snow.  The title is terrific and intriguing.  Do you mean the architectural "central boss of a volute" or the top of a volute, a spiraled seashell?  I took it to mean the latter, and enjoy such an implication.  Wonderfully put together.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of this mountain complex in this weather.  I love the moody darkness surmounted by snow.  The title is terrific and intriguing.  Do you mean the architectural "central boss of a volute" or the top of a volute, a spiraled seashell?  I took it to mean the latter, and enjoy such an implication.  Wonderfully put together.', '2020-01-12 09:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650339, 1244215, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such a view, in the silence, can empty one out of petty cares and concerns.  Beautiful.  I just want to walk this road.</td>', 'Such a view, in the silence, can empty one out of petty cares and concerns.  Beautiful.  I just want to walk this road.', '2020-01-12 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7650340, 1244264, 173844, '<td valign="top">Spectacular.  So stunning that after a moment it drifts into a reverie.  Breathe this air and jump to life.<br/>One of two favorites in the challenge.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>.<br/>This came in 14th at 6.2?  That''s crazy.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-01-12 09:51:53.</i></td>', 'Spectacular.  So stunning that after a moment it drifts into a reverie.  Breathe this air and jump to life.One of two favorites in the challenge....This came in 14th at 6.2?  That''s crazy.', '2020-01-12 09:48:30.000000', '2020-01-12 09:51:53.000000', 0),
(7650341, 1244291, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely offset geometry.  Wonderful lightness of touch, and that slice of sky.  A calm, soothing image.  Good medicine for a troubled soul.</td>', 'Lovely offset geometry.  Wonderful lightness of touch, and that slice of sky.  A calm, soothing image.  Good medicine for a troubled soul.', '2020-01-12 09:57:39.000000', NULL, 0),
