(7663374, 1244334, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Shame to waste this absolute beauty of an image, one its not really a landscape and two its not black-and-white, I can see tinges of red. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Red?  Where? I don''t see it. I''m slightly color blind and red disappears sometimes; is this what happened to you also?</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Shame to waste this absolute beauty of an image, one its not really a landscape and two its not black-and-white, I can see tinges of red.  Red?  Where? I don''t see it. I''m slightly color blind and red disappears sometimes; is this what happened to you also?', '2020-05-21 17:40:03.000000', NULL, 0);
